      "content": "that's a really strong rebuttal. it definitely makes the non-voter look like they're just being passive. but i want to make it even punchier. can you add a section that frames those who choose to boycott elections as being fundamentally selfish? like, they're just looking out for their own convenience or personal principles while letting everyone else deal with the consequences of the decisions made? really lean into the idea that staying home is an act of civic selfishness.",
